%% Diagram 1 · Complete research concept
flowchart LR
  A["1 Reference samples<br/>K = 1–10 dies (normal; optional known defects)"] --> B["2 Sample enrolment<br/>preprocess, crop, align to template"]
  B --> C["3 Feature extraction<br/>frozen pretrained encoder, multi-scale"]
  C --> D["4 Reference memory M<br/>patch features + prototypes, versioned"]
  D --> E["5 New die inspection<br/>unseen die, any orientation"]
  E --> F["6 Anomaly detection<br/>distance to memory → anomaly score"]
  F --> G["7 Defect localisation<br/>anomaly map, regions, boxes"]
  G --> H["8 Engineer verification<br/>confirm / reject / correct / label"]
  H --> I["9 Reference adaptation<br/>gated, reversible memory update"]
  I -. verified knowledge .-> D
  G --> O["Output: status · heat map · score · confidence"]
